# BACnet/IP datagrams from a capture of a live, routed BACnet system, one per
# line; spaces only group the bytes. Addresses are anonymized: the origin of
# every Forwarded-NPDU is aa.bb.cc.dd:48059.
#
# Each line ends where its BVLC length says. The capture held 3 more bytes of
# Ethernet padding after the Who-Is-Router-To-Network frame, which are not
# part of the datagram.

